{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1086480-spirit-3-control-spirit","id":1086480,"title":"Spirit 3 - Control Spirit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-01T22:35:04-07:00","id":1086480,"title":"Spirit 3 - Control Spirit","content":"I have a funny player wanting to issue a comment &quot;Obey me for half a day&quot;, which being complex would probably require 2 or 3 results, but it goes against the purpose of the spell anyway.<br /> <br /> However if I was talking about D&amp;D I would just reply &quot;not possible&quot;, but this being Mage I think I should find a way to make it work.<br /> <br /> What do you think?<br /> * Just ask for 2 or 3 results? After all &quot;half a day&quot; could be a scene for all we know.<br /> * By accepting this, I open the door to &quot;Obey me for eternity&quot; and others<br /> * Otherwise I can push for him to use it as is (more or less), but I should advise on the dot requirement for what he wants (5 dots?)<br /> <br /> Look forward to your feedback!<br /> <br /> Btw, I use Mage version 1, not that much into the new versions.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1842-rluengo","name":"rluengo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T23:26:38-07:00","id":1086489,"title":"","content":"One the duration of the spell ends, the spirit is no longer in control of the mage. If he didn't boost the duration, this spell will not last long enough for half a day of commands.<br /> <br /> Oops. Forget what I said. I don't know how duration works on 1st ed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T00:20:06-07:00","id":1086506,"title":"","content":"I don't recall if there is an exact rule for whether the spirit has to obey the spirit of the command given or not to twist that and leave the mage there while obeying someone named mei &gt;.&gt;. Either way, I'd likely make it acknowledge the command &quot;Obey me for half a day&quot; and when he gives his first command, make it do that command for half a day, or until the command was complete - whichever occurred first. If the spell has a duration, I would make it fulfill that command for half a day over and over again (or until the duration ran out) - if it did not, then I would make it until the command was completed. And then I would make the spirit -pissed-.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1513-jakondite","name":"Jakondite","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T15:09:47-07:00","id":1086822,"title":"","content":"If the spirit is not to weak, it could have Status in the local spirit court. It could have a rank 4 spirit lord to complain to and demand action against the tyrant mage.<br /> Or the Totem spirit of a pack of fire-touched werewolves might owe this spirit a favor.<br /> <br /> Your overbearing mage might suddenly find many spirits causing trouble for him or the Concilium. Or even receive threats from werewolves!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11799-rbawintrow","name":"RBAWintrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11799_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T16:19:38-07:00","id":1086857,"title":"","content":"If you haven't bumped Duration up to last half a day then (Which incidentally is a meaningless increment since Advanced Duration jumps from 1 Scene to 1 Day, but that's beside the point) you can command the spirit to obey you for a half a day but it only has to continue to obey that command until the Duration runs out which could be well before half a day has passed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T17:11:50-07:00","id":1088007,"title":"","content":"The spell is ultimately only as good as its Duration. You'll have to bump it up to Advanced for half a day or longer. One of my players just did this, having 'sealed' a storm spirit inside an item, and then cast Slumber on the entity. Since he was paranoid, he placed the Duration to a full year!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4260-terpsichordean","name":"terpsichordean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4260_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}